Package: ODRCC
Title: Tools for Modeling and Inference with Outcome-Dependent Right-Censored Covariates
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jesus", "Vazquez", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jesusepfvazquez@gmail.com")
Description: Estimators for a linear regression model with a right-censored
    covariate when the censoring depends on the outcome: the inverse probability
    weighting (IPW) estimator, the joint maximum likelihood estimator, and the
    unguarded and guarded augmented IPW (AIPW) estimators, each with sandwich
    standard errors, plus the effective sample size of the IPW weights. The
    methods accompany the manuscript by Vazquez, Ma, Marder, and Garcia on
    outcome-dependent right-censored covariates, motivated by Huntington disease.
